%U A399038 366677739934219693796262580265672165625,627576734632447109745304231797964050358902890625,3066743764139528476973759372639667790142400923655935390625
%N A399038 Product of the distinct entries on the two main diagonals of the (2*n + 1) X (2*n + 1) square spiral.
%H A399038 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulam_spiral">Ulam spiral</a>.
%F A399038 a(n) = Product_{k = 1..n} ((4*k^2 - 2*k + 1)*(4*k^2 + 1)*(4*k^2 + 2*k + 1)*(4*k^2 + 4*k + 1)).
%e A399038 For n = 1, the array is:
%e A399038   5 4 3
%e A399038   6 1 2
%e A399038   7 8 9,
%e A399038 and a(1) = 1*3*5*7*9 = 945.
%o A399038 (PARI) a(n) = prod(k = 1, n, (4*k^2 - 2*k + 1)*(4*k^2 + 1)*(4*k^2 + 2*k + 1)*(4*k^2 + 4*k + 1)); \\ _Michel Marcus_, Oct 09 2026
